       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ARITHSIZE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT.
           DISPLAY WS-COUNT.
           COMPUTE WS-COUNT = WS-COUNT + 99.
           DISPLAY WS-COUNT.
           MULTIPLY 2 BY WS-COUNT.
           DISPLAY WS-COUNT.
           STOP RUN.
